cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Seoul Climate Card (기후동행카드): replication materials for effects on public transport use and car traffic"
abstract: >-
  Code, aggregated results and figures for a master's thesis evaluating Seoul's
  Climate Companion Card (launched 2024-01-27) with generalised synthetic control
  (409 within-Seoul OD pairs; 149 TOPIS road sites) and synthetic control
  (12 directional road links around Yeouido; transit from Yeouido-dong, 79 donors).
  Raw smart-card OD data are export-restricted and not included.
authors:
  - alias: jayhaja
repository-code: "https://github.com/jayhaja/seoul-climate-card"
url: "https://jayhaja.github.io/seoul-climate-card/"
license:
